MID_MV13_05: <SH>
MID_MV13_05_m001: (big attack exert)
MID_MV13_05_m002: (attack exerts x2)
MID_MV13_05_m003: (pained exerts)
MID_MV13_05_m004: Tu! Prendi quella ragazza come ostaggio!
MID_MV13_05_m005: Huh?!
MID_MV13_05_m006: (grunting)
MID_MV13_05_m007: Maledetti!
MID_MV13_05_m008: (noticing something strange)
MID_MV13_05_m009: È pesante!
MID_MV13_05_m010: Non si muove! Com'è possibile?
MID_MV13_05_m011: Ehi! Meno scherzi e portatela via!
MID_MV13_05_m012: Siamo seri! Non riusciamo a sollevarla!
MID_MV13_05_m037: Santo cielo.
MID_MV13_05_m013: Come fa a essere così pesante?!
MID_MV13_05_m014: Che maleducati! Mostrate un po' di rispetto!
MID_MV13_05_m015: (exert when thrown)
MID_MV13_05_m016: (exert when thrown)
MID_MV13_05_m017: (exert upon collision)
MID_MV13_05_m018: (exert upon collision)
MID_MV13_05_m019: (exert upon collision)
MID_MV13_05_m020: (astounded exert)
MID_MV13_05_m021: Come osate rivolgervi a me in quel modo...?
MID_MV13_05_m022: (surprised exert)
MID_MV13_05_m023: (scared exert)
MID_MV13_05_m024: Non è affatto carino!
MID_MV13_05_m025: (scream exert)
MID_MV13_05_m026: (shocked breath)
MID_MV13_05_m027: (adlib)
MID_MV13_05_m028: Va tutto bene! Ci sono andata piano con loro.
MID_MV13_05_m029: "Piano"? Con una statua? Sul serio?
MID_MV13_05_m030: ("hm?" sound)
MID_MV13_05_m031: Qualcuno avrebbe qualcosa... da ridire.
MID_MV13_05_m032: Whaa?!
MID_MV13_05_m033: Siamo in svantaggio. Scappiamo!
MID_MV13_05_m034: (shout of fear)
MID_MV13_05_m035: Che disastro.
MID_MV13_05_m036: (sighing exert)